#: qml/ConfigBehavior.qml:50
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"If you're using this setting to work around an application that demands "
"attention too often, first look for a setting in the app to disable that "
"behavior. If you don't find one, consider reporting this as a bug to the "
"app's developer."
msgstr ""
"Tu es usante iste preferentia per circumferer un application que demanta "
"troppo sovente attention, prime cerca un preferentia in le appper "
"dishabilitar ille comportamento. Si tu non trova un, considera reportar isto"
" como un falta al disveloppator del application."

#: qml/ConfigBehavior.qml:98
msgctxt "@info displayed as InlineMessage"
msgid ""
"The compositor does not support displaying windows side by side, so a "
"textual list will be displayed instead."
msgstr ""
"Le compositor non supporta monstrar fenestras latere per latere, assi que un"
" lista textual essera monstrate in loco."

